    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……でもね、怖くてよかったとも思ったの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だって甘奈、これから『甘奈のことを見て！』って\r\n言いに行くんだもん",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "もしかしたら、それで、\r\n見る前から『嫌だ』って言われるかもしれない",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ちゃんと見てくれた人たちから、\r\n『満足できない』って言われるかもしれない",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それを怖いって思うのは普通のことでしょ？\r\nオーディション落ちたらめーっちゃへこむと思うし",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……そう。落ちたらめーっちゃへこむんだよ\r\n悲しいし、悔しいの。……きっとそう思うんだと思う",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから、今──……甘奈、ちゃんと、受かりたいんだなって\r\nそういう実感ができたから、『怖くてよかった』",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そうか。なるほどな\r\n……でも、じゃあ。怖いままで大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううんっ、もちろん☆　怖がるのはここまで\r\nプロデューサーさんの前で置いていくの",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "怖いのは普通で、\r\nそう思っちゃうことは怖がらなくていいんだから──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601400307/6014003070100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6014003070110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈はバッチリな笑顔で、\r\nお客さんたちを楽しませてくるだけだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
